&lt;p&gt;Medsien is a venture-backed healthcare SaaS company experiencing rapid growth and looking to expand our team. We are seeking an organized, motivated, and passionate &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;QA Engineer&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt; / Senior Software Test Engineer &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;to join our team of talented and inspiring developers in a fast-paced environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;QA Engineer&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt; / Senior Software Test Engineer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll be a part of the SW Engineering Team and collaborate closely with the Product Managers. We&#39;re looking for a candidate who will design and scale robust automation frameworks, help drive the adoption of AI-assisted and agentic approaches in our testing processes, and perform hands-on testing. You will have the opportunity to shape test automation practices and drive AI adoption in testing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This fully remote position is based in Istanbul under a contractor agreement with Medsien Inc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Senior QA Engineer&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt; / Senior Software Test Engineer&lt;/span&gt;, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the end-to-end test strategy for our web applications, from planning through release,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain scalable test automation frameworks using Selenium and Playwright (Java),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate and maintain automated test suites in Jenkins CI/CD pipelines with GitHub-based workflows,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools effectively across the testing lifecycle: test design, test data generation, code review, and defect analysis,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and apply agentic architectures (AI agents, multi-agent workflows) to automate and accelerate QA activities,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform functional, regression, API, and exploratory testing,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track quality metrics and contribute to release readiness assessments,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in test code reviews,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with developers, product managers, and designers to embed quality throughout the development lifecycle,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve testing processes and advocate for quality best practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in Agile/Scrum ceremonies, contributing to sprint planning, stand-ups, and retrospectives,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve issues with a proactive and analytical mindset,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research new technologies and prototype new ideas,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high testability and quality of delivered software,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Engineering and external third-party integrators on production and development to ensure good functional test coverage and reproducible results,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know the product vision and work closely with designers and the product owner to translate their vision into tests,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with development teams to identify key risk areas in new solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please apply if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in software testing, with at least 5 years in test automation,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience with Selenium and Playwright,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid programming skills in Java; clean, maintainable test code,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building and maintaining CI/CD pipeline with Jenkins,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Git and GitHub (branching strategies, pull requests, code reviews, GitHub actions),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using AI tools (e.g., LLM-based assistants, AI coding agents) to improve testing efficiency and quality,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with agentic systems and AI-driven automation concepts,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with API testing (Postman, REST Assured),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with bug tracking and test management tools (e.g., Jira, TestRail),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ISTQB Foundation Level certification,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
