&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thank you for taking the time to apply for a position at Medsien!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Medsien is the leading provider of scalable remote care management for a quality patient experience. Hundreds of organizations trust Medsien’s unparalleled technology solutions to implement exceptional remote care management programs, personalize every interaction, and improve the lives of the people who need it most. Based in San Francisco and venture-backed by top-tier investors, Medsien was founded to reimagine remote care management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 60% of all U.S. adults—over 150 million people—live with at least one chronic condition, which requires dedicated, ongoing medical support outside the four walls of their doctor’s office. And yet, only 20% of these patients have access to remote care from the comfort of their homes, putting their health at significant risk. Together, we can save lives and create a real impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Medsien is a venture-backed healthcare SaaS company experiencing rapid growth and looking to expand our team.&amp;nbsp;We are seeking organized, motivated, and passionate &lt;strong&gt;Talent Acquisition Specialists&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;to join our team of talented and inspiring colleagues in a fast-paced environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Talent Acquisition &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specialist,&lt;/strong&gt; you will work closely with all departments of the organization. You will engage with various internal stakeholders, assess their human resources requests, challenge them to secure the best talent possible, and actively contribute to our organization&#39;s healthy growth. We are looking for candidates who are passionate about building a strong and competent team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with internal stakeholders requesting additional human resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively manage the recruitment process end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure proper documentation and adherence to our company values and practices during the recruitment process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and attract qualified candidates, manage job posts, evaluate the applications, conduct the initial CV screening and HR interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up the relevant technical and hiring manager interviews, ensure all feedback is received in our ATS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve hiring quality metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance the end-to-end candidate experience by leveraging candidate feedback, recruitment analytics, and continuous improvement practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications / Desired Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;University degree in social sciences, management or economics,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5+ years of experience in recruitment,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competency in computer skills,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with recruiting sourcing tools, HR systems, spreadsheets, and collaborative tools,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative, driven, and can navigate through ambiguity, with a desire to work in a fast-paced, results-driven environment,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, interpersonal, and presentation skills,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter and a Doer who can work well with individuals at all levels,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A naturally curious person who is open to new approaches/ ideas and eager to learn and stretch his/her boundaries,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A people-centered approach: you are approachable and empathetic, a go-to contact for HR questions and support,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretion, reliability, and a strong focus on security and privacy in handling personal data,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ability to work with Eastern US time, with typical workdays from 16:00 to 00:00 Turkey time,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Perfect English skills&lt;/span&gt;, both written and oral,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Residing in Istanbul city center.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and stock options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible vacation and PTO policies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully remote work opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training, mentorship, and coaching from leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;Please bear in mind that:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;This is a &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;permanent-term contractor&lt;/span&gt; job opportunity with Medsien Inc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;This position is based in Istanbul and requires 16:00-00:00 workdays.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
